  {
   "id": "ninja-gaiden-4@major-2026-03-04",
   "gameId": "ninja-gaiden-4",
   "displayName": "NINJA GAIDEN 4: The Two Masters Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-04T02:13:28.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Xbox Series X|S / Microsoft Store™ / Steam® / PlayStation®5",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "##",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "■The Two Masters DLC",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*The Two Masters DLC is now available to those who have purchased The Two Masters separately, or to those who have purchased either the Deluxe Edition or Deluxe Upgrade.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・New story content included in The Two Masters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*Players will need to have completed the base game’s story on any difficulty in order to access the new story content included in The Two Masters DLC.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・New weapons: Solitaire (Yakumo) & Jakotsumon (Ryu)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*These weapons will be unlocked immediately (if you haven’t yet cleared the tutorial, they will be unlocked from the chapter Bloodsoaked Tokyo)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45457667/2c9b7be1e029f10554fd9a3bf0e9a2cb3a6ec32a.jpg\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45457667/9215b5fb99f3ed7e81606a8eb6c8bd6e32435802.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・New mode: Abyssal Road",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*This mode will unlock after completing The Two Masters story content on any difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45457667/704f47a55e59f44fe15b17e46d653a125c529d3a.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・New Trials",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*These new trials will unlock after completing The Two Masters story content on any difficulty.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45457667/486b07a1ff45546619694eff8cecc218b7bc76a7.jpg\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45457667/259c1d19ab3cf75e9a6eac8cda5b2766bcb56c7b.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・New enemies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・New accessories",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・New trophies/achievements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "■Free Update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・New “Weapon Sets” feature to customize weapon/ninpo wheel layout",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*Accessible from the Equipment menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Ability to skip sequence that triggers when player dies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Controller layout and mouse & keyboard layout options added to initial bootup settings",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "■Adjustments",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・Added invincibility frames to the startup of the following moves:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "[table equalcells=\"1\" colwidth=\",\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Universal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・(Fatal Flash）Up until the moment required to perform a Perfect Fatal Flash",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Takeminakata",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Twin Blades）↓↑Y/△",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Twin Blades）Rotate Stick + X/□",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Tachi）↓↑Y/△",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yatousen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Lance）↓↑Y/△",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kage-Hiruko",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Assassin’s Tools）Rotate Stick + X/□",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Mechanical Arms）↓↑Y/△",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dark Dragon Blade",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Base）Rotate Stick + X/□",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Shadow-gleam）Rotate Stick + Y/△",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dragon Sword",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Base）Rotate Stick + X/□",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・（Gleam）Rotate Stick + Y/△",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・When using Twin Blades, can cancel out of mid-air Y/△ attack after striking the ground.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・When using Twin Blades, can cancel out of mid-air Y/△ attack into an Ultimate Technique after striking the ground.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Slightly increased the homing properties of Wind Run",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Burabura enemies will now drop essence when you defeat them",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "*They will not drop essence when they self-destruct",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjusted the transparency of enemies in front of the camera to improve visibility during combat",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "■Major fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・Slightly reduced loading times",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue which made the targeting of on-landing ultimate techniques unreliable when there is no directional input following a Wind Path.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue that resulted in missing invincibility frames during a follow-up heavy attack (Mirage) after a Perfect Reverse Wind.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Made it less likely to fall off ledges when performing a Wind Path or jump shuriken.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 6 (“Guiding Winds”): Fixed an issue that would make it impossible to progress after falling out of bounds from a specific area",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 8 (“Drowned District”): Fixed an issue that caused players to fall out of bounds in a specific area after performing an Obliteration Technique against an Ilcanis, making it impossible to progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 11 (“Infiltration”): Fixed an issue that caused players to fall out of bounds in a specific area when using Raven Gear before being detected by an enemy, making it impossible to progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 19 (“Ebon Wings): Fixed an issue where, during the battle with Ryu, Ryu would step out of the stage’s bounds, making it impossible to progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 6 (“Guiding Winds”): Fixed an issue that caused lighting flickers in certain areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 3 (“Phantom Pleasure Quarter”): Fixed an issue where impact from the pulse wave emitted when Kitsune Courtesan changes phases would prevent players from achieving Untouchable.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 12 (“Dragon’s Maw”): Fixed an issue that would prevent accumulation of Ninja Coin and exp from enemies who die from falling off ledges in specific areas.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・CHAPTER 11 (“Infiltration”): Fixed an inaccuracy in the displayed Purgatory enemy information",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue that caused the transition to the game over screen after dying as Ryu during a Trial to be longer than when playing as Yakumo.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Other minor fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "■Major fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue with certain configurations that would prompt players to update their drivers regardless of whether their system required an update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
